   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## KDX Wildcard Studio + LLM + Resolution - Z-Image Turbo\n\nA ready text-to-image graph with every KDX pack and only built-in ComfyUI nodes besides them.\n\n1. **KDX Wildcard Studio** (sidebar tab on the left): pick categories and templates, repeat count, Manual / Pin. Every Run makes the next prompt.\n2. **LLM pill** in the panel: off = the template goes straight to the sampler; on = **KDX LLM Chat** rewrites it first (set your OpenAI-compatible server in *LLM server*).\n3. **KDX Prompt Extractor** takes the aspect ratio written in the prompt (templates end with one, e.g. `16:9`) or the LLM's `aspect_ratio`, and **KDX AutoRes** turns it into a native Z-Image size.\n4. **Your own prompt**: unmute (Ctrl+M) the text node on the left and its text is used instead of the templates; mute it again to go back.\n5. Files are named after the template (`portrait_woman_20261126_101500`).\n\n**Models** (ComfyUI offers to download them when they are missing):\n- `diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors`\n- `text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors`\n- `vae/ae.safetensors`\n\nNeeds ComfyUI-KDX-Wildcard-Studio, ComfyUI-KDX-LLM and ComfyUI-KDX-Resolution."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## KDX Wildcard Studio + LLM + Resolution - Z-Image Turbo\n\nA ready text-to-image graph with every KDX pack and only built-in ComfyUI nodes besides them.\n\n1. **KDX Wildcard Studio** (sidebar tab on the left): pick categories and templates, repeat count, Manual / Pin. Every Run makes the next prompt.\n2. **LLM pill** in the panel: off = the template goes straight to the sampler; on = **KDX LLM Chat** rewrites it first (set your OpenAI-compatible server in *LLM server*).\n3. **KDX Prompt Extractor** takes the aspect ratio written in the prompt (templates end with one, e.g. `16:9`) or the LLM's `aspect_ratio`, and **KDX AutoRes** turns it into a native Z-Image size.\n4. **Your own prompt**: unmute (Ctrl+M) the text node on the left and its text is used instead of the templates; mute it again to go back.\n5. Files are named after the template (`portrait_woman_20261126_101500`).\n\n**Models** (ComfyUI offers to download them when they are missing):\n- `diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors`\n- `text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors`\n- `vae/ae.safetensors`\n\nNeeds ComfyUI-KDX-Wildcard-Studio, ComfyUI-KDX-LLM and ComfyUI-KDX-Resolution."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
